  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dnewgame\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/New_Game/BH_NG_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"400\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>NEW GAME 3 現已推出 -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/new-game-3\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡！</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">New Game 的目標純粹是擴展遊戲的可能性，同時不會破壞「原版」的遊玩體驗。為此，所有內建模組都會遵循 Minecraft 預設主題，並且這些改動將與遊戲風格完美兼容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/new-game-little\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組太多了？下載精簡版吧！</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/New_Game/BH_NG_Summary.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">這是一款理想的整合包，適合所有想要擴增生態域、建築、生物、次元或其他 Minecraft 分支內容的玩家，但又不希望任何模組添加超出「常規」範圍的內容，這正是許多玩家所期望的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">實際上，這是一款內容豐富且平衡性極佳的整合包，深受玩家喜愛。它包含了生態域、敵人、礦物、建築、食物等多種模組，將全面提升玩家在遊戲中的體驗。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🎮 享受全新且優化過的遊戲體驗，並保有原版美學風格，這要歸功於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>AmbientSounds</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambient-environment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Ambient Environment</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sound-physics-remastered\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Sound Physics Remastered</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Falling Leaves</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Visual Workbench</strong></span></a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Advancement Plaques</strong></span></a> 等模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🏘️ 尋找並探索新建築，搭配知名模組如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Additional Structures</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Awesome Dungeon</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/yungnickyoung/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>YUNG's</strong></span></a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Medieval Buildings</strong></span></a>，還有更多等你在探索中發現...</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🏔️ 生態域至關重要，今天也不例外。透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Biomes O' Plenty</strong></span></a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-makeover\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Biome Makeover</strong></span></a> 探索全新的植被景觀。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🥇 New Game 大幅提升了遊戲的多個面向，例如透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better Advancements</strong></span></a> 優化挑戰進度、使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Better Animations Collection</strong></span></a> 改善生物動畫，甚至透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ai-improvements\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>AI Improvements</strong></span></a> 升級敵方 AI。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🐘 沒有 Alex 的模組，Minecraft 還叫 Minecraft 嗎？透過經典模組 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Alex's Mobs</strong></span></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Alex's Caves</strong></span></a> 發現大量新動物，征服全新洞穴地牢。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🪑 每個人都有家，雖然大家的裝飾品味各不相同……現在有了 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Supplementaries</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Adorn</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Handcrafted</strong></span></a> 或經典的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Macaw's</strong></span></a> 模組提供的裝飾資源，你的居家佈置絕對會更輕鬆愉快。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">💍 建立家庭、撫養子女，並透過經典又革新重製的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-comes-alive-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>MCA Reborn</strong></span></a> 教導他們對抗敵人。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🌊 探索海洋、捕撈新魚種並尋獲珍寶，千萬別錯過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Aquaculture 2</strong></span></a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fish-of-thieves\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Fish of Thieves</strong></span></a> 帶來的豐富水下資源。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🎒 以更自由的方式探索世界，善用全新的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Sophisticated Backpacks</strong></span></a>，並利用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Waystones</strong></span></a> 傳送門快速返回家中……</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">🧟‍♂️ 你將迎戰更強大的新敵人，以及許多完全嶄新的挑戰。在众多模組中，不妨體驗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/progressive-bosses\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Progressive Bosses</strong></span></a> 的新機制，或是挑戰經典的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Mutant Monsters</strong></span></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">👬 當然，這也是非常適合多人聯機的整合包，並已內建最佳化模組與光影。搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Complementary Shaders</strong></span></a>，享受更加精彩刺激的遊戲畫面吧。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">‼️ 還有超多內容等你發掘，像是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Farmer's Delight</strong></span></a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Artifacts</strong></span></a>、次元探索、礦物資源等等。如果你對 New Game 還一無所知，那就趕快開始享受吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dnewgame\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/New_Game/BH_NG_Promo.webp\" width=\"1401\" height=\"251\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果你正在尋找能和朋友暢玩任何整合包的伺服器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dnewgame\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a></strong></span> 就是你的最佳解決方案！他們提供 CP 值最高的 Minecraft 伺服器，點擊 <strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dnewgame\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></span></strong> 並輸入優惠碼「Lupin」，即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/New_Game/BH_NG_FAQ.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>Minecraft 一直載入中？進入世界後 FPS 卻很低？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">請務必<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmundominecraft.net%252fen%252fallocate-more-ram%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">增加記憶體（RAM）</a></strong>，多數問題都源於此。如果你使用 CurseForge 應用程式，只需點擊設定檔選項，取消勾選「使用系統預設記憶體」，並將滑桿向右拉動即可（我們建議至少設定為 6GB 或 6144 MB）。 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果發現仍然不夠，請繼續增加記憶體配置！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>伺服器出現錯誤嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">很遺憾，若是自行架設伺服器，或租用未經我推薦的虛擬主機，此整合包可能無法正常運作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本整合包與 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dnewgame\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a></strong> 完美相容，因此強烈建議選擇該主機服務。此外，透過 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252flupin%253fr%253dnewgame\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong> 租用並輸入優惠碼「Lupin」，同樣可享 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">請注意，此整合包建議至少配置 7GB 記憶體。若玩家人數較多，請考慮進一步增加記憶體容量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/New_Game/BH_NG_Images.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/774/196/2023-12-13_21.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/774/198/2023-07-18_17.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/774/199/2023-07-18_17.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"913\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/774/200/2023-12-13_21.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/774/201/2023-12-13_21.png\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
